OL,3,AHorrified witnesses recount fatal
OL,4,Arollercoaster incident at Six Flags
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains some
OL,7,Fgraphic details
OL,9,FOne person has died and others were
OL,10,Finjured after an incident on a
OL,11,Frollercoaster at an amusement park in
OL,12,Fthe US state of Georgia.
OL,14,FThe Cobb County Police Department is
OL,15,Finvestigating Monday's death at Six
OL,16,FFlags Over Georgia, about 15 miles
OL,17,F(24km) from Atlanta.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
