OL,3,AHorrified witnesses recount fatal
OL,4,Arollercoaster incident at Six Flags
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ride involved has not been
OL,7,Fspecified but aerial footage from news
OL,8,Fhelicopters showed the Goliath
OL,9,Frollercoaster stopped midway, with
OL,10,Friders being helped off by workers.
